{"2210050": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dragonium Adventure", "steam_appid": 2210050, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [2382340, 3667770], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simple but complex gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dragonium Adventure is a turn-based combat RPG that uses a few simple fundamental mechanics: Attack, Defense and Objects. During the course of your adventure you will clash with many enemies, one more powerful than the other: to face them, you will need to constantly change and improve your strategy, and to do so, you will have to make use of new fighting techniques and tools. Learn to master these elements and become Akinori's best fighter! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210050/extras/5295df71d8886974761f5aabed3775ff.poster.avif?t=1766341452\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210050/extras/5295df71d8886974761f5aabed3775ff.webm?t=1766341452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210050/extras/5295df71d8886974761f5aabed3775ff.mp4?t=1766341452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Akinori has been quiet for millennia since the last sighting of a monster, but apparently these mysterious creatures have made their appearance again - it's up to you to figure out what's happening and restore peace to the kingdom. Fight, improve yourself and save Akinori! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 8 zones to explore with 5 levels per zone, divided into 3 normal levels, 1 mini-boss and 1 boss! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Improve your character by acquiring more powerful fighting techniques! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Free Akinori from the malus and find out what's happening! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210050/extras/fea1572bf781e4d5081e9392c7a7049e.poster.avif?t=1766341452\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210050/extras/fea1572bf781e4d5081e9392c7a7049e.webm?t=1766341452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210050/extras/fea1572bf781e4d5081e9392c7a7049e.mp4?t=1766341452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Add spice to the fight!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many different combat techniques: from those that simply hit the enemy and inflict damage, to those that restore your health, give you an advantage in battle, and more. By defeating enemies, you will obtain Experience points that will be used to fill the Experience Bar. Once filled, you will advance one Level, and every now and then you may acquire new combat techniques. Master the combat techniques and create a moveset that suits the situation! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210050/extras/8ecfa156f244a3d378353e78c9b82642.poster.avif?t=1766341452\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210050/extras/8ecfa156f244a3d378353e78c9b82642.webm?t=1766341452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210050/extras/8ecfa156f244a3d378353e78c9b82642.mp4?t=1766341452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Power up with Medals!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Medals grant passive effects to the player. There is one for each enemy you will encounter in Dragonium Adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their effects are varied: increasing attack, defense, speed... and more! You can upgrade Max Medals by defeating the corresponding enemies and thus increasing their level, increasing the passive effect granted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can upgrade a Medal to a maximum of level 3.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can equip up to a maximum of 3 at a time, so combine their effects based on your moveset and the enemy in front of you! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210050/extras/a25b91be7884c3edbd1593120e6f5141.poster.avif?t=1766341452\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210050/extras/a25b91be7884c3edbd1593120e6f5141.webm?t=1766341452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210050/extras/a25b91be7884c3edbd1593120e6f5141.mp4?t=1766341452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Test yourself in Rush mode!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat many enemies, one after the other, with a completely random moveset!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to survive as long as possible: plan a winning strategy with what you come across and you will prevail. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rush mode is great for getting Max Medals and acquiring fighting techniques that cannot be obtained in Story mode. More fighting techniques will be added via free updates after the game launches, and the only way to obtain them is by increasing your level in Rush mode. You will be able to expand your strategy and show it off in online multiplayer battles (coming after launch)! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210050/extras/d5a619ce23f2b8db1d8c34c0d60fbe7c.poster.avif?t=1766341452\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210050/extras/d5a619ce23f2b8db1d8c34c0d60fbe7c.webm?t=1766341452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210050/extras/d5a619ce23f2b8db1d8c34c0d60fbe7c.mp4?t=1766341452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>To unlock this mode, you need to reach a certain point in the game in order to become familiar with the combat system and acquire the fundamental fighting techniques.</i> </p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simple but complex gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dragonium Adventure is a turn-based combat RPG that uses a few simple fundamental mechanics: Attack, Defense and Objects. During the course of your adventure you will clash with many enemies, one more powerful than the other: to face them, you will need to constantly change and improve your strategy, and to do so, you will have to make use of new fighting techniques and tools. Learn to master these elements and become Akinori's best fighter! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210050/extras/5295df71d8886974761f5aabed3775ff.poster.avif?t=1766341452\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210050/extras/5295df71d8886974761f5aabed3775ff.webm?t=1766341452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210050/extras/5295df71d8886974761f5aabed3775ff.mp4?t=1766341452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Akinori has been quiet for millennia since the last sighting of a monster, but apparently these mysterious creatures have made their appearance again - it's up to you to figure out what's happening and restore peace to the kingdom. Fight, improve yourself and save Akinori! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 8 zones to explore with 5 levels per zone, divided into 3 normal levels, 1 mini-boss and 1 boss! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Improve your character by acquiring more powerful fighting techniques! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Free Akinori from the malus and find out what's happening! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210050/extras/fea1572bf781e4d5081e9392c7a7049e.poster.avif?t=1766341452\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210050/extras/fea1572bf781e4d5081e9392c7a7049e.webm?t=1766341452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210050/extras/fea1572bf781e4d5081e9392c7a7049e.mp4?t=1766341452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Add spice to the fight!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many different combat techniques: from those that simply hit the enemy and inflict damage, to those that restore your health, give you an advantage in battle, and more. By defeating enemies, you will obtain Experience points that will be used to fill the Experience Bar. Once filled, you will advance one Level, and every now and then you may acquire new combat techniques. Master the combat techniques and create a moveset that suits the situation! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210050/extras/8ecfa156f244a3d378353e78c9b82642.poster.avif?t=1766341452\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210050/extras/8ecfa156f244a3d378353e78c9b82642.webm?t=1766341452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210050/extras/8ecfa156f244a3d378353e78c9b82642.mp4?t=1766341452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Power up with Medals!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Medals grant passive effects to the player. There is one for each enemy you will encounter in Dragonium Adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their effects are varied: increasing attack, defense, speed... and more! You can upgrade Max Medals by defeating the corresponding enemies and thus increasing their level, increasing the passive effect granted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can upgrade a Medal to a maximum of level 3.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can equip up to a maximum of 3 at a time, so combine their effects based on your moveset and the enemy in front of you! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210050/extras/a25b91be7884c3edbd1593120e6f5141.poster.avif?t=1766341452\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210050/extras/a25b91be7884c3edbd1593120e6f5141.webm?t=1766341452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210050/extras/a25b91be7884c3edbd1593120e6f5141.mp4?t=1766341452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Test yourself in Rush mode!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat many enemies, one after the other, with a completely random moveset!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to survive as long as possible: plan a winning strategy with what you come across and you will prevail. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rush mode is great for getting Max Medals and acquiring fighting techniques that cannot be obtained in Story mode. More fighting techniques will be added via free updates after the game launches, and the only way to obtain them is by increasing your level in Rush mode. You will be able to expand your strategy and show it off in online multiplayer battles (coming after launch)! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210050/extras/d5a619ce23f2b8db1d8c34c0d60fbe7c.poster.avif?t=1766341452\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210050/extras/d5a619ce23f2b8db1d8c34c0d60fbe7c.webm?t=1766341452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210050/extras/d5a619ce23f2b8db1d8c34c0d60fbe7c.mp4?t=1766341452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>To unlock this mode, you need to reach a certain point in the game in order to become familiar with the combat system and acquire the fundamental fighting techniques.</i> </p>", "short_description